bonsai-astryx
=============

This project is an unofficial, unaffiliated port of the Astryx design system to
OCaml / Jane Street's Bonsai. It is not endorsed by or affiliated with Meta
Platforms, Inc. or Jane Street Group, LLC.

Upstream work this project derives from
---------------------------------------

Astryx
  Source:  https://github.com/facebook/astryx
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.

  Portions of this repository's documentation are GENERATED from Astryx's own
  machine-readable component documents (the `packages/core/src/<Name>/<Name>.doc.mjs`
  files), which describe each component's intended usage, prop contract,
  anatomy and accessibility requirements. Those extracted descriptions remain
  the work of the Astryx authors and are redistributed here under the MIT
  license above. Every generated file records the component it came from.

  Generated artefacts derived from Astryx:
    - registry.json                       (extracted prop/usage/a11y contract)
    - docs/components/*.md                (per-component reference text)
    - docs/INDEX.md                       (component index)
    - docs/visual/*.md, tokens.json       (if present: extracted visual contract)

OCaml / Bonsai
  Source:  https://github.com/janestreet/bonsai
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) Jane Street Group, LLC.

  This project depends on, but does not vendor, Jane Street's Bonsai libraries.

Astryx's own dependency licences (StyleX, React) apply to the upstream packages
only; nothing from those projects is redistributed here. Where a port reuses
compiled CSS emitted by the upstream build, the upstream MIT notice above covers
it and the file records its origin.

